  "description": "The threshold-2of3-cosignature credential cut to one of its three signatures, the primary's, under a verifier state that holds the issuer's three Ed25519 keys and requires two of them (requiredSignatures: 2). The one signature verifies, so a verifier that checks only that every declared signature verifies, and reads no threshold, wrongly accepts. Verifier MUST REJECT with a threshold reason.",
